WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 line:92%
-Welcome to the show, Brian.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:04.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They metaled it up for me.
That was really nice.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll take it.
-Yeah.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
They know -- they know
who you are, man.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is about
how you grew up a nerd.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is this an actual photo of you
as a kid, too?

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is, sadly.
-That's fantastic.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You like that
'70s bowl haircut?

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.816 line:92%
-I like the '70s bowl haircut.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.352 size:78% position:39%
I like that you could
match the T-shirt.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.353 line:92%
You have a 9-year-old now.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I do.
-Is he -- How's he growing up?

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.290 line:92%
Is he living that nerd life?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He has no choice, man.
-Yeah.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.093 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's gonna happen
with half of me in him.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's gonna be
at least half a nerd.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:32.766 line:92%
-But are you hopeful for that?

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel like that is
a path you embrace?

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, people love nerds now.
-Yeah.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.139 line:92%
-It's not the '70s anymore.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:41.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I haven't pushed anything
on him.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been, like,
kind of passive.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just -- you know, I just
introduce him to these things.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't say
you have to like this.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
The big one for me
was the band Rush.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.252 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience cheers ]

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love heavy metal,
and I love other stuff.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I love Rush
more than anything.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.924
Rush is my -- one of my all-time
favorite bands.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.627
So one day we were in the car
listening to "Tom Sawyer."

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:03.063
And he heard -- he's heard Rush
his whole life.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he goes,
"Hey, Dad, you know.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think Rush
is my favorite band."

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:10.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I, like, start to tear up.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my wife was like,
"You dork."

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:13.339 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.543
But I'm just afraid that it's
gonna -- you know, I don't --

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.846
I want him to still think I'm
cool and I'm worried about

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
when he's gonna
rebel against me.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:25.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause he's just gonna go,
you know, "Rush sucks.

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.220 line:92%
Stephen King is terrible.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:27.787 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're not funny.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:31.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm gonna start, you know,
a Sublime tribute band."

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:32.492 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:36.596
"And become a conservative.
I hope you're cool with it."

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.764 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I'll still love you,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:41.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
my little right-wing
Sublime tribute band boy.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It'll be hard. It'll be hard.
But you'll still love him.

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:46.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
You obviously -- You're tall.
-Yeah.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:49.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Was that -- did that not help
as a kid?

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.010 line:92%
-I was always a little tall,

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.379 size:78% position:39%
but I got really tall
after high school.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:57.350
I grew eight inches in one year
from 18 to 19.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-Yeah.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't even know
that could happen.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:01.554 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.989 line:92%
I had literal growing pains,

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
like
"American Werewolf in London"

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
[bleep] where I'm just --
[ Growls ]

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
My arms extending
while I'm sleeping.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was terrible.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.401 line:92%
And then I turned into Hodor.

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:16.703 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You Hodor'd.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.673
-But if I would have been
Hodor size in high school,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.642
I would have definitely used it
to my advantage.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:25.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I would have been
putting bullies through walls,

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.214 size:84% position:42%
like, "Who did you call
a queerbate? Hodor!"

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.883 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:33.286
I would have saved other nerds
just running through the school.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hodor, Hodor, Hodor!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.924
-Did you -- Did you ever, like,
tussle with other nerds?

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.225 line:92%
Were there ever nerd fights?

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sadly, yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:45.265
I got beaten up by everybody.
I was the lowest at the school.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.566 line:92%
I got beaten up by a girl.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got beaten up
by a special ed kid.

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:52.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I got in a nerd fight
in my neighborhood with --

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was the heavy metal nerd
in my neighborhood.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my friend Ian
was the punk rock nerd.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.445 size:81% position:41%
And one day we decided
we were gonna fight.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were both sophomores,
and he's mad at me.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.651
I think maybe 'cause I wanted to
bang his stepsister.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not sure. But anyway.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:09.889 size:78% position:39%
It's a long time ago.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.290 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Blurry.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he decides
we're gonna fight.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:12.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
We both decide
we're gonna fight.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:15.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to do this.
I can't fight.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never thrown a punch,
still haven't.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:18.631 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And so we're fighting,

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
and everybody wants to see
the nerd fight.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.870
So they're all around us
in a circle at my bus stop,

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:27.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the gravel,
and we take our glasses off.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.442 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:31.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
Both nerds.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It happens.

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:33.479 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And then we go at it.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:36.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there's, like,
no real punches thrown.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like a lot of
half hugging and shoving.

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:40.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:42.255 line:92%
Like, "Stop," and "Don't."

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:42.755 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:45.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's all me
making the weird noises.

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:46.159 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I'm humiliated.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:50.296
Like, I hate school every day,
but this is, like, the lowest.

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:51.631 line:92%
I want this to end so badly.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:54.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
So his glasses fall off
out of his jacket.

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:55.635 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I'm like, "Oh, man,

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:59.305
this is a dick move, but this is
how I end this thing."

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:02.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just stomped on
his glasses.

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:03.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:04.777 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-They were my glasses!

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:10.416 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.551 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I didn't even look.

00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:13.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so confident,
I just went stomp.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:16.556
And you know, you guys as an
audience got to experience that

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:18.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
the way these kids
in my neighborhood did.

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:21.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
They all went from,
"What an ass[bleep]"

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
to, "Oh, my God,
what an [bleep]"

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:24.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:26.699 line:92%
Now I have to go on the ground.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:27.700 line:92%
And I can't see anything.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:31.037
So I have to find my glasses,
and they're in six pieces.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:35.208
And now I have to walk all
the way home two or three blocks

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:36.175 size:88% position:44% line:92%
not able to see anything

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:39.579
and tell my mom that Ian stomped
on my glasses.

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.113 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:41.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
But that's only gonna be
in that book.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:44.617 size:84% position:42%
Like John Cena does not
have a similar story.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, that's true.

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:49.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you want that story,
you got to read this book.

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:50.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Congrats on the book.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's fantastic.
Thanks so much for being here.

